import DifferentialGeometry.Geometry.Collapse.LocalExport.LocalChartPacketsResidualProducer

/-!
# Producer of the final family with LC73's zero shell clauses (`LocalChartPacketsZ`)

`eventually_nonempty_localChartPacketsZ`: the statement of `eventually_nonempty_localChartPacketsR`
(same binders, same order) with `LocalChartPacketsZ … ζ Λ'`, where `ζ` is LC73's adapted quality
(the bound variable `β₁ < ζ < 1`) and `Λ'` the zero ratio threshold chosen with `εr, δ'` (and
`T ≥ 20Λ'`). The proof is that of the R producer, keeping LPA05's X82 and LC73 clauses
(`lpa05_selected_zero_packets_with_local_comparison`, fourth and fifth clauses) on the SAME zero
family, which the R producer drops.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

noncomputable section

open Set Function Metric Bundle Manifold Filter
open scoped ContDiff Manifold Topology NNReal
open DifferentialGeometry.Topology.Ehresmann
open DifferentialGeometry.Topology.Manifold
open DifferentialGeometry.Geometry.Riemannian
